  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-04-02T19:19:16.683Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, if a player has “audio from camera” enabled, they will show up as having everyone else muted. This is bad, as A. other players will assume you can’t hear them, 2. certain groups do not allow staff to be muted, and will remove you from the instance, and III. other players may mute you back or even block you, assuming you have them muted, as muting is generally understood to be a moderative action.\n\nInstead of that icon, a unique icon specifically for this feature should appear above the head of players using it\n\n(This may already be planned, just haven’t had the icon made yet. If so, great! if not, though, it needs to be)",
